  "prefLabel": "Res 2704.08 Additional Grant Review Committee Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 2704.08 Additional Grant Review Committee Meetings. The grant review committee may hold additional meetings for the purpose of reviewing applications if the JTP administrator determines that the quantity of applications is more than can be reviewed at a scheduled meeting. Notification shall be posted on the DED website at least 3 business days in advance of any additional scheduled meetings.\n\nSource. #8975, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRED: 3-12-08\n\nNew. #9498, eff 7-1-09 (from Res 2704.07), EXPIRED: 7-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res2700.html"
